{"id":"34fa28c2966187ff","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-atomic-formula.md","title":"原子公式","display":"df-atomic-formula — 原子公式","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-atomic-formula","aliases":["28-df-atomic-formula"],"display":"df-atomic-formula — 原子公式","depends_on":["[[28-df-first-order-syntax]]"],"source_status":"local-support-definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-atomic-formula"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-atomic-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-atomic-formula — 原子公式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"acf90b9de82eb78c\" href=\"?note=acf90b9de82eb78c\" title=\"28-df-first-order-syntax\">28-df-first-order-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"local-support-definition"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-atomic-formula-—-原子公式-$\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$\">df-atomic-formula — 原子公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,\\mathrm{Term}_S,\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\">\\(S,\\mathrm{Term}_S,\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"acf90b9de82eb78c\" href=\"?note=acf90b9de82eb78c\" title=\"28-df-first-order-syntax\">28-df-first-order-syntax</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\doteq\">\\(\\doteq\\)</span> 与关系应用是互异的语法树构造子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\coloneqq\\{t_1\\doteq t_2\\mid t_1,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\}\\cup\\{R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\land R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\\land(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\coloneqq\\{t_1\\doteq t_2\\mid t_1,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\}\\cup\\{R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\land R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\\land(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>零元关系应用允许空参数列；等号不是可自由解释的关系符号。</p>\n<p>来源状态：本目录的自足支撑定义；不把此形式语言包装或模型论扩展冒称原书编号定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-atomic-formula-—-原子公式-$\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$","text":"df-atomic-formula — 原子公式 $\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-first-order-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"acf90b9de82eb78c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-first-order-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-first-order-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"acf90b9de82eb78c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,\\mathrm{Term}_S,\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)$ 来自 [[28-df-first-order-syntax]]。$\\doteq$ 与关系应用是互异的语法树构造子。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"S,\\mathrm{Term}_S,\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\doteq","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\coloneqq\\{t_1\\doteq t_2\\mid t_1,t_2\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\}\\cup\\{R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\mid n\\in\\mathbb N\\land R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\\land(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S^n\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":930,"backlinks":[{"id":"33292a1a991cbb70","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$ 的常元为 $0$，一元函数为 $S$，二元函数为 $+,\\times$，二元关系为 $<$；标准结构为 $\\mathfrak N=(\\mathbb N,0,S,+,\\times,<)$。语法、满足与自由变量来自 [[28-df-formula]]、[[28-df-satisfaction]]、[[28-df-free-variable]]。$\\mathrm{AtFml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}$ 来自 [[28-df-atomic-formula]]；$\\mathrm{Term}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}},\\mathrm{Var},\\mathrm{var}$ 来自 [[28-df-first-order-syntax]]；$\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak N)$ 来自 [[28-df-assignment]]。\n$\\exists x<t\\,\\psi$、$\\forall x<t\\,\\psi$ 为下式构造的有界量词语法缩写，$x\\notin\\mathrm{var}(t)$；$\\varphi\\equiv_{\\mathfrak N}\\psi$ 为下式定义的标准模型等价关系。$\\bar x$ 为非空有限变量列。"},{"id":"d9d9a691a7b0cc03","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S,\\mathrm{Var}$ 来自 [[28-df-first-order-syntax]]，$\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$ 来自 [[28-df-atomic-formula]]。$\\neg,\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow,\\forall,\\exists$ 为互异的有限有序树构造子。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-184","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"语法与语义：[[28-df-atomic-formula]]、[[28-df-formula]]、[[28-df-free-variable]]、[[28-df-bound-variable]]、[[28-df-sentence]]、[[28-df-assignment]]、[[28-df-structure]]、[[28-df-term-interpretation]]、[[28-df-satisfaction]]。"}],"outgoing":["acf90b9de82eb78c"]}